{%- comment -%}
  The ZOREV Pair: one offer, one markup, wherever it is sold.

    Homepage band (sections/bundle-builder) and /collections/the-pair
    (sections/main-collection):
      {% render 'pair-offer', uid: section.id, anchor: 'pair', heading_level: 2,
                body: s.body, photo: s.photo, photo_mobile: s.photo_mobile,
                video: s.video, photo_alt: s.photo_alt %}

    Just the stone plate with two products on it (collection list tiles):
      {% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'plate', a: product_a, b: product_b,
                ratio: '4 / 3', sizes: '120px' %}

    One packshot, cut to the product itself (product cards, price lists):
      {% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'img', product: p, variant: v,
                widths: '240,360,480', sizes: '…', cls: 'my-img', alt: 'none' %}

  WHAT IT PROMISES, AND WHY IT IS TRUE
  The price block ("$47 / $55 / Save $8") comes from snippets/pair-price,
  the single source for pair money (Theme settings > Offers, currency
  guarded). The saving itself is Shopify's automatic "The ZOREV Pair" Buy X
  Get Y discount; this band adds one of each product and says what that
  discount does. It never computes or simulates a discount.

  The band reads the bag, because the saving does not apply to every bag.
  With G units of A (GODA) and H units of B (HOYGI) in the bag AFTER the add,
  Shopify applies the pair, once per order, when
      G >= 1 and H >= 1 and (H <= 2 or G >= H)
  (measured against the real cart: 1+1, 2+1, 1+2, 2+2, 3+1, 3+3, 4+2 apply;
  1+3, 2+3, 1+4 do not). The same rule is window.ZorevPair.applies in
  assets/zorev.js and the Liquid below. Three states, rendered from the
  cart the page was built with and kept in step with every cart:painted:
    offer    "Add the pair · $47" and "The $8 comes off automatically in
             your bag, once per order."
    in-bag   Shopify's own discount list for this bag already holds the
             pair: a plain "Add one of each" (no price: the saving is once
             per order) and a note with a link to the bag.
    blocked  one more of each would not get the saving: no figures at all,
             "Add one of each" and a plain explanation.

  THE PICTURE
  One shared stone plate (.zv-studio), with the makers' own studio
  packshots of both products standing side by side on one floor line, each
  with the same soft contact shadow: one environment, nothing composited
  into a scene. The packshots are cut to the product itself on Shopify's
  CDN (image_url crop: 'region'), so every option of the oil, whatever
  white margin its supplier photograph has, stands on the same line at the
  same height as the balm. The boxes are measured once, below, per studio
  file; any other picture is shown whole, contained and standing on the
  floor. The oil's packshot follows the option chosen: radio swatches
  drive it, by script and, without script, by :has().

  NO SCRIPT
  The form posts items[][id] / items[][quantity] for both products to
  /cart/add, which lands on the cart page; the option radios themselves are
  the first items[][id]. With script, they are renamed pair_a as soon as the
  band loads and a hidden items[][id] mirrors the checked one: Shopify's
  own analytics listener treats a changing input named like a variant id
  inside a cart form as a product-page variant switch and logs an error on
  pages without a product (home, the Pair collection). With script, the band posts the
  same two lines to /cart/add.js once, then opens the bag drawer
  (ZorevCart.show(button) so focus comes back to the button) and refreshes
  it. While posting, the button is aria-busy / aria-disabled, never
  disabled, so it keeps focus.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign m = mode | default: 'band'
-%}
{%- case m -%}
{%- when 'img' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    One packshot. Picks, for the option: the first studio slot whose file
    has a measured box (a clean packshot that can stand on a floor), else
    the first studio slot, else the option's own Shopify image, else the
    product's. Measured boxes are per-mille of the file: left,top,right,
    bottom of the product including its box, plus a hair of margin.
      3674552c… GODA Black (supplier, 1600²)   363ece56… GODA White (625×708)
      cf28bc68… GODA Citrus (800²)             21732292… GODA Neutral (800²)
      zorev-hoygi-cutout HOYGI stick + box (577×741, transparent)
    Params: product, variant, widths, sizes, cls, loading, fetchpriority,
    alt ('none' = decorative), wrap (a class: wraps the img in a stand
    span with the picture's proportions), wrap_attrs, shadow (true: a
    contact shadow inside the stand). output: 'url' prints only the URL of
    the chosen packshot, cut to the product, url_width wide (default 240,
    never above the file) — for JSON data such as snippets/pair-data.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign p = product
    assign v = variant
    if v == blank and p != blank
      assign v = p.selected_or_first_available_variant
    endif
    if p == blank and v != blank
      assign p = v.product
    endif

    assign table = '3674552c:177,137,767,933|363ece56:72,59,831,970|cf28bc68:204,134,801,868|21732292:212,130,804,865|zorev-hoygi-cutout:42,31,956,964' | split: '|'
    assign img = false
    assign first_hit = false
    assign box = ''
    assign is_studio = false
    if settings.studio_mode == 'on' and v != blank
      assign vid = v.id | append: ''
      for n in (1..10)
        assign kv = 'studio_' | append: n | append: '_variant'
        assign ki = 'studio_' | append: n | append: '_image'
        assign sv = settings[kv] | append: '' | strip
        if sv == vid and settings[ki] != blank
          assign cand = settings[ki]
          if first_hit == blank
            assign first_hit = cand
          endif
          assign probe = cand | image_url: width: 10
          assign box = ''
          for row in table
            assign kp = row | split: ':'
            if probe contains kp[0]
              assign box = kp[1]
              break
            endif
          endfor
          if box != blank
            assign img = cand
            break
          endif
        endif
      endfor
      if img == blank and first_hit != blank
        assign img = first_hit
        assign box = ''
      endif
      if img != blank
        assign is_studio = true
      endif
    endif
    if img == blank and v != blank
      assign img = v.featured_media.preview_image
    endif
    if img == blank and p != blank
      assign img = p.featured_media.preview_image
    endif
  -%}
  {%- if img != blank -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign iw = img.width | default: 1000 | plus: 0
      assign ih = img.height | default: iw | plus: 0
      assign cut = false
      assign x0 = 0
      assign y0 = 0
      assign cw = iw
      assign ch = ih
      if box != blank
        assign bx = box | split: ','
        assign bl = bx[0] | plus: 0
        assign bt = bx[1] | plus: 0
        assign br = bx[2] | plus: 0
        assign bb = bx[3] | plus: 0
        assign x0 = iw | times: bl | divided_by: 1000 | floor
        assign x1 = iw | times: br | divided_by: 1000 | floor
        assign y0 = ih | times: bt | divided_by: 1000 | floor
        assign y1 = ih | times: bb | divided_by: 1000 | floor
        assign cw = x1 | minus: x0
        assign ch = y1 | minus: y0
        if cw > 0 and ch > 0
          assign cut = true
        else
          assign x0 = 0
          assign y0 = 0
          assign cw = iw
          assign ch = ih
        endif
      endif

      assign ws = widths | default: '160,240,320,400,480,560' | split: ','
      assign srcset = ''
      assign src_w = 0
      for w in ws
        assign wn = w | strip | plus: 0
        if wn < 1 or wn >= cw
          continue
        endif
        if cut
          assign u = img | image_url: width: wn, crop: 'region', crop_left: x0, crop_top: y0, crop_width: cw, crop_height: ch
        else
          assign u = img | image_url: width: wn
        endif
        if srcset != ''
          assign srcset = srcset | append: ', '
        endif
        assign srcset = srcset | append: u | append: ' ' | append: wn | append: 'w'
        assign src_w = wn
      endfor
      if cut
        assign u = img | image_url: width: cw, crop: 'region', crop_left: x0, crop_top: y0, crop_width: cw, crop_height: ch
      else
        assign u = img | image_url: width: cw
      endif
      if srcset != ''
        assign srcset = srcset | append: ', '
      endif
      assign srcset = srcset | append: u | append: ' ' | append: cw | append: 'w'
      if src_w == 0
        assign src_w = cw
      endif
      assign h_attr = ch | times: src_w | divided_by: cw | round
      if cut
        assign src_u = img | image_url: width: src_w, crop: 'region', crop_left: x0, crop_top: y0, crop_width: cw, crop_height: ch
      else
        assign src_u = img | image_url: width: src_w
      endif

      if alt == 'none'
        assign alt_text = ''
      elsif alt != blank
        assign alt_text = alt
      else
        assign alt_text = p.title
        if p.has_only_default_variant == false and p.variants.size > 1 and v != blank
          capture opt_label
            render 'zvlabel', t: v.title
          endcapture
          assign alt_text = alt_text | append: ', ' | append: opt_label
        endif
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if output == 'url' -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign uw = url_width | default: 240 | plus: 0
        if uw > cw
          assign uw = cw
        endif
        if cut
          echo img | image_url: width: uw, crop: 'region', crop_left: x0, crop_top: y0, crop_width: cw, crop_height: ch
        else
          echo img | image_url: width: uw
        endif
      -%}
    {%- else -%}
    {%- if wrap != blank -%}<span class="{{ wrap }}{% if is_studio %} is-studio{% else %} is-photo{% endif %}{% if cut %} is-cut{% endif %}" style="aspect-ratio: {{ cw }} / {{ ch }}"{% if wrap_attrs != blank %} {{ wrap_attrs }}{% endif %}>{%- endif -%}
    <img{% if cls != blank %} class="{{ cls }}"{% endif %}
         src="{{ src_u }}"
         srcset="{{ srcset }}"
         sizes="{{ sizes | default: '100vw' }}"
         width="{{ src_w }}" height="{{ h_attr }}"
         alt="{{ alt_text | strip_html | escape_once }}"
         data-zv-studio="{{ is_studio }}"
         {%- if loading == 'eager' %} loading="eager"{% else %} loading="lazy" decoding="async"{% endif -%}
         {%- if fetchpriority == 'high' %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>
    {%- if wrap != blank -%}{%- if shadow -%}<span class="zpp__shadow" aria-hidden="true"></span>{%- endif -%}</span>{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

{%- when 'plate' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    The shared stone plate. a = the left product (default: Theme settings >
    Offers > Product A), b = the right one (optional). swap: true renders a
    stand for every available option of a, all but the default one off,
    for the band's swatches to switch between. ratio: the plate's
    proportions (default 5 / 4). sizes: one stand's rendered width.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign pa = a
    if pa == blank
      assign pa = settings.pair_product_a
    endif
    assign pb = b
    assign va = pa.selected_or_first_available_variant
    assign st_sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 900px) 260px, 40vw'
    assign st_widths = widths | default: '160,240,320,400,480,560'
  -%}
  {%- if pa != blank -%}
    <div class="zpp zv-studio{% if cls != blank %} {{ cls }}{% endif %}"{% if ratio != blank %} style="aspect-ratio: {{ ratio }}"{% endif %} data-zpp>
      <div class="zpp__floor">
        {%- if swap and pa.variants.size > 1 -%}
          {%- for pv in pa.variants -%}
            {%- if pv.available or pv.id == va.id -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign st_cls = 'zpp__stand'
                if pv.id != va.id
                  assign st_cls = 'zpp__stand is-off'
                endif
                assign st_attrs = 'data-zpr-cut="' | append: pv.id | append: '"'
              -%}
              {% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'img', product: pa, variant: pv, wrap: st_cls, wrap_attrs: st_attrs, shadow: true, cls: 'zpp__img', widths: st_widths, sizes: st_sizes %}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'img', product: pa, variant: va, wrap: 'zpp__stand', shadow: true, cls: 'zpp__img', widths: st_widths, sizes: st_sizes %}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if pb != blank -%}
          {% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'img', product: pb, variant: pb.selected_or_first_available_variant, wrap: 'zpp__stand', shadow: true, cls: 'zpp__img', widths: st_widths, sizes: st_sizes %}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    <style>
      /* The plate: warm stone, a soft light from above and a slightly
         deeper floor, so it reads as one surface the products stand on.
         Nothing in here may create a stacking context between the plate
         (isolated by .zv-studio) and the packshots, or multiply would have
         nothing to dissolve the supplier's white into: no z-index,
         transform, filter or opacity on .zpp__floor / .zpp__stand. */
      .zpp.zv-studio{--zv-studio-pad:0;position:relative;display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:5 / 4;
        background-image:var(--zv-stage-light),linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 52%,var(--zv-plate-deep))}
      .zpp__floor{position:absolute;left:5%;right:5%;bottom:13%;height:60%;
        display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;gap:6%}
      .zpp__stand{position:relative;display:block;height:100%;flex:0 1 auto;min-width:0}
      .zpp__stand.is-off{display:none}
      .zpp.zv-studio .zpp__img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;padding:0;
        object-fit:contain;object-position:50% 100%}
      /* the same contact shadow under each product, on the one floor line */
      .zpp__shadow{position:absolute;z-index:-1;left:50%;bottom:-3%;width:100%;height:8%;
        transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--zv-stage-shadow);filter:blur(5px);opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
      /* No studio picture for a product (studio images off): its own
         photograph as a small square print standing on the floor. */
      .zpp__stand.is-photo{height:78%}
      .zpp.zv-studio .zpp__stand.is-photo .zpp__img{object-fit:cover;mix-blend-mode:normal;border-radius:var(--zv-r-md);box-shadow:var(--zv-sh-2)}
      .zpp__stand.is-photo .zpp__shadow{display:none}
      /* an option switch: the new packshot settles in, no slide */
      @keyframes zpp-in{from{opacity:0}}
      .zpp__stand[data-zpr-cut] .zpp__img{animation:zpp-in var(--zv-d-ui) var(--zv-ease) both}
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.zpp__stand[data-zpr-cut] .zpp__img{animation:none}}
    </style>
  {%- endif -%}

{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign pa = settings.pair_product_a
    assign pb = settings.pair_product_b
    assign hl = heading_level | default: 2 | plus: 0
    if hl < 2
      assign hl = 2
    elsif hl > 4
      assign hl = 4
    endif
    assign rid = 'zpr-' | append: uid
    assign anchor_id = anchor | default: 'pair'
  -%}
  {%- if settings.pair_enabled and pa != blank and pb != blank and pa.title != blank and pb.title != blank -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign va = pa.selected_or_first_available_variant
      assign vb = pb.selected_or_first_available_variant
      assign avail_a = pa.variants | where: 'available'
      assign short_a = pa.vendor | upcase
      assign short_b = pb.vendor | upcase

      capture pp
        render 'pair-price'
      endcapture
      capture p_full
        render 'pair-price', part: 'full'
      endcapture
      capture p_save
        render 'pair-price', part: 'save'
      endcapture
      assign pp = pp | strip
      assign p_full = p_full | strip
      assign p_save = p_save | strip

      assign can_add = true
      if avail_a.size == 0 or vb.available == false
        assign can_add = false
      endif

      assign g = 0
      assign h = 0
      for it in cart.items
        if it.product_id == pa.id
          assign g = g | plus: it.quantity
        elsif it.product_id == pb.id
          assign h = h | plus: it.quantity
        endif
      endfor
      assign g1 = g | plus: 1
      assign h1 = h | plus: 1
      assign pair_ok = false
      if h1 <= 2 or g1 >= h1
        assign pair_ok = true
      endif
      assign in_bag = false
      for app in cart.discount_applications
        if app.title == settings.pair_discount_title
          assign in_bag = true
        endif
      endfor
      assign state = 'offer'
      if in_bag
        assign state = 'in-bag'
      elsif pair_ok == false
        assign state = 'blocked'
      endif

      assign has_photo = false
      if photo != blank or video != blank
        assign has_photo = true
      endif
    -%}
    {%- capture lab_offer -%}Add the pair{% if pp != blank %} · {{ pp }}{% endif %}{%- endcapture -%}
    <div class="zpr zv-forest" id="{{ anchor_id | escape }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="{{ rid }}-h"
         data-zpr data-state="{{ state }}"
         data-a-product="{{ pa.id }}" data-b-product="{{ pb.id }}"
         data-title="{{ settings.pair_discount_title | escape }}">
      <div class="zv-wrap zpr__in">
        {%- if has_photo -%}
          <figure class="zpr__photo" data-zv-reveal="media">
            {% render 'zv-media', media: video, image: photo, image_mobile: photo_mobile, sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 640px, 92vw', alt: photo_alt %}
          </figure>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="zpr__fig" data-zv-reveal>
            {% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'plate', a: pa, b: pb, swap: true, sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 260px, 40vw' %}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="zpr__copy" data-zv-reveal>
          <span class="zv-eyebrow zpr__k">{{ settings.pair_name | escape }}</span>
          <h{{ hl }} class="zpr__h" id="{{ rid }}-h">{{ short_a | escape }} + {{ short_b | escape }}</h{{ hl }}>
          {%- if pp != blank -%}
            <p class="zpr__price" data-zpr-price>
              <strong><span class="visually-hidden">Pair price </span>{{ pp }}</strong>
              <s><span class="visually-hidden">Regular price </span>{{ p_full }}</s>
              <span class="zpr__save">Save {{ p_save }}</span>
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.pair_tagline != blank -%}
            <p class="zpr__tag">{{ settings.pair_tagline | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <ul class="zpr__inc" role="list">
            <li><span class="zpr__qty">1 &times;</span> <a href="{{ pa.url }}">{{ pa.title | escape }}</a></li>
            <li><span class="zpr__qty">1 &times;</span> <a href="{{ pb.url }}">{{ pb.title | escape }}</a></li>
          </ul>
          {%- if body != blank -%}<div class="zpr__body">{{ body }}</div>{%- endif -%}

          <form class="zpr__form" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" data-no-ajax data-zpr-form>
            {%- if avail_a.size > 1 -%}
              <fieldset class="zpr__opts">
                <legend class="zpr__legend">{{ short_a | escape }} option</legend>
                <div class="zpr__optlist">
                  {%- for pv in avail_a -%}
                    <label class="zpr__opt">
                      <input class="zpr__radio" type="radio" name="items[][id]" value="{{ pv.id }}" data-zpr-opt{% if pv.id == va.id %} checked{% endif %}>
                      <span class="zpr__sw zv-studio" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'pair-offer', mode: 'img', product: pa, variant: pv, widths: '96,128,192', sizes: '56px', cls: 'zpr__swimg', alt: 'none' %}</span>
                      <span class="zpr__optl">{% render 'zvlabel', t: pv.title %}</span>
                    </label>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
              </fieldset>
            {%- else -%}
              <input type="hidden" name="items[][id]" value="{{ va.id }}" data-zpr-opt>
            {%- endif -%}
            <input type="hidden" name="items[][quantity]" value="1">
            <input type="hidden" name="items[][id]" value="{{ vb.id }}" data-zpr-b>
            <input type="hidden" name="items[][quantity]" value="1">
            <div class="zpr__act">
              <button class="zv-btn zpr__btn" type="submit" data-zpr-add
                      data-label-offer="{{ lab_offer | escape }}" data-label-plain="Add one of each"
                      {%- unless can_add %} disabled{% endunless %}>
                {%- if can_add == false -%}Sold out{%- elsif state == 'offer' -%}{{ lab_offer | escape }}{%- else -%}Add one of each{%- endif -%}
              </button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <p class="zpr__note" data-zpr-note="offer">One of each. {% if p_save != blank %}The {{ p_save }}{% else %}The pair saving{% endif %} comes off automatically in your bag, once per order.</p>
          <p class="zpr__note zpr__note--ok" data-zpr-note="in-bag">{% render 'zicon', name: 'check' %}<span>{{ settings.pair_name | escape }} is in your bag{% if p_save != blank %}, saving {{ p_save }}{% endif %}. The saving applies once per order. <a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">View bag</a></span></p>
          <p class="zpr__note" data-zpr-note="blocked">Your bag already has more {{ short_b | escape }} than {{ short_a | escape }}, so one more of each would not get the pair saving. Every saving shows in your bag before checkout.</p>
          <p class="zpr__err" role="alert" data-zpr-err hidden></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <style>
      .zpr{position:relative;padding-block:var(--zv-section);background:var(--zv-bg);color:var(--zv-text);scroll-margin-top:72px}
      .zpr [hidden]{display:none !important}
      .zpr__in{display:grid;gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px);align-items:center}
      @media (min-width: 900px){.zpr__in{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,.95fr)}}
      .zpr__fig{width:100%;max-width:640px;margin-inline:auto}
      .zpr__fig .zpp{box-shadow:var(--zv-plate-edge)}
      @media (max-width: 899px){.zpr__fig{max-width:520px}}
      .zpr__photo{margin:0 auto;width:100%;max-width:640px;aspect-ratio:4 / 3;border-radius:var(--zv-r-lg);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--zv-plate-edge)}
      @media (max-width: 899px){.zpr__photo{max-width:480px;aspect-ratio:5 / 4}}

      .zpr__copy{max-width:540px}
      .zpr__k{color:var(--zv-accent)}
      .zpr__h{margin:var(--zv-2) 0 var(--zv-4);font-family:var(--zv-serif);font-weight:400;font-size:var(--zv-t-h2);
        line-height:var(--zv-lh-tight);letter-spacing:var(--zv-tr-tight);color:var(--zv-text)}
      .zpr__price{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:6px 14px;margin:0 0 var(--zv-3);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;max-width:none}
      .zpr__price strong{font-family:var(--zv-sans);font-size:var(--zv-t-h2);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1;color:var(--zv-text)}
      .zpr__price s{font-size:var(--zv-t-lead);color:var(--zv-text-2)}
      .zpr__save{align-self:center;font-size:var(--zv-t-micro);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:var(--zv-tr-caps);text-transform:uppercase;
        color:var(--zv-on-accent);background:var(--zv-accent);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:var(--zv-r-pill)}
      .zpr__tag{margin:0 0 var(--zv-4);font-family:var(--zv-serif);font-size:var(--zv-t-h4);line-height:var(--zv-lh-snug);color:var(--zv-text);max-width:none}
      .zpr__inc{list-style:none;margin:0 0 var(--zv-4);padding:0;display:grid;gap:0;font-size:var(--zv-t-sm);line-height:var(--zv-lh-body);color:var(--zv-text-2)}
      /* each product link is a 44px-tall target (brief), without spacing
         the two lines apart more than the text needs */
      .zpr__inc a{display:inline-block;min-height:44px;padding-block:10px;color:var(--zv-text);
        text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--zv-hairline-2);text-underline-offset:3px}
      @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine){.zpr__inc a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}}
      .zpr__qty{color:var(--zv-text-3);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
      .zpr__body{color:var(--zv-text-2)}
      .zpr__body p{margin:0 0 var(--zv-3);color:inherit}

      /* GODA option: radio swatches, each the option's own packshot on a
         small plate with its name under it. The native radio covers the
         whole swatch (invisible), so a click anywhere picks it, the arrow
         keys move between options and a screen reader hears "Black, radio
         button, 1 of 4". */
      .zpr__opts{margin:0 0 var(--zv-4);padding:0;border:0;min-width:0}
      .zpr__legend{padding:0;margin:0 0 var(--zv-2);font-size:var(--zv-t-micro);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:var(--zv-tr-caps);
        text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--zv-text-2)}
      .zpr__optlist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--zv-2)}
      @media (max-width: 359px){.zpr__optlist{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
      .zpr__opt{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:44px;
        padding:8px 4px 10px;border:1px solid var(--zv-hairline-2);border-radius:var(--zv-r-md);cursor:pointer;text-align:center;
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
        transition:border-color var(--zv-d-hover) var(--zv-ease),background-color var(--zv-d-hover) var(--zv-ease)}
      .zpr__radio{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}
      .zpr__sw{display:block;width:100%;max-width:56px;aspect-ratio:1 / 1;--zv-studio-pad:9%;border-radius:var(--zv-r-sm)}
      .zpr__optl{font-size:var(--zv-t-fine);line-height:1.25;color:var(--zv-text)}
      .zpr__opt:has(.zpr__radio:checked){border-color:var(--zv-accent);background-color:var(--zv-bg-raised);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--zv-accent)}
      .zpr__radio:checked ~ .zpr__optl{font-weight:600}
      .zpr__opt:has(.zpr__radio:focus-visible){outline:2px solid var(--zv-focus);outline-offset:2px}
      @supports not selector(:has(*)){
        .zpr__radio:checked ~ .zpr__sw{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--zv-accent)}
        .zpr__radio:focus-visible ~ .zpr__sw{outline:2px solid var(--zv-focus);outline-offset:3px}
      }
      @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine){.zpr__opt:hover{border-color:var(--zv-text-3)}}
      @media (hover: none){.zpr__opt:active{transform:scale(var(--zv-press));transition-duration:var(--zv-d-tap)}}

      .zpr__act{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--zv-3);align-items:center}
      .zpr__btn{min-height:52px;flex:1 1 240px}
      /* once the offer no longer applies to this bag, the button is plain */
      .zpr[data-state="in-bag"] .zpr__btn,.zpr[data-state="blocked"] .zpr__btn{background:transparent;color:var(--zv-text);border-color:var(--zv-ghost-edge)}

      .zpr__note{display:none;margin:var(--zv-4) 0 0;font-size:var(--zv-t-fine);line-height:var(--zv-lh-body);color:var(--zv-text-2);max-width:54ch}
      .zpr[data-state="offer"] [data-zpr-note="offer"],
      .zpr[data-state="blocked"] [data-zpr-note="blocked"]{display:block}
      .zpr[data-state="in-bag"] [data-zpr-note="in-bag"]{display:flex;gap:var(--zv-2);align-items:flex-start;color:var(--zv-text)}
      .zpr[data-state="blocked"] [data-zpr-price]{display:none}
      .zpr__note .zicon{flex:0 0 auto;width:16px;height:16px;margin-top:3px;color:var(--zv-accent)}
      .zpr__note a{color:var(--zv-text);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
      .zpr__err{margin:var(--zv-3) 0 0;padding:var(--zv-2) var(--zv-3);border-left:2px solid var(--zv-accent);border-radius:var(--zv-r-xs);
        background:var(--zv-bg-raised);font-size:var(--zv-t-fine);color:var(--zv-text);max-width:54ch}

      /* The oil's packshot follows the checked option, with or without
         script (the script also sets .is-off, for browsers without :has). */
      {%- for pv in avail_a %}
      #{{ anchor_id | escape }}:has([data-zpr-opt][value="{{ pv.id }}"]:checked) .zpp__stand[data-zpr-cut]{display:none}
      #{{ anchor_id | escape }}:has([data-zpr-opt][value="{{ pv.id }}"]:checked) .zpp__stand[data-zpr-cut="{{ pv.id }}"]{display:block}
      {%- endfor %}
    </style>
    <script>
    (function () {
      'use strict';
      var roots = document.querySelectorAll('[data-zpr]:not([data-zpr-ready])');
      Array.prototype.forEach.call(roots, function (root) {
        root.setAttribute('data-zpr-ready', '');
        var form = root.querySelector('[data-zpr-form]');
        var btn = root.querySelector('[data-zpr-add]');
        var err = root.querySelector('[data-zpr-err]');
        if (!form || !btn) return;
        var aId = Number(root.getAttribute('data-a-product'));
        var bId = Number(root.getAttribute('data-b-product'));
        var title = root.getAttribute('data-title') || '';
        var soldOut = btn.disabled;
        var busy = false;

        /* The one pair rule, from assets/zorev.js (a deferred script, so it
           is looked up when needed, not now). Same expression as fallback. */
        function applies(g, h) {
          var P = window.ZorevPair;
          if (P && typeof P.applies === 'function') return !!P.applies(g, h);
          return g >= 1 && h >= 1 && (h <= 2 || g >= h);
        }
        function discounts(c) {
          if (typeof window.ZorevDiscountsOf === 'function') return window.ZorevDiscountsOf(c);
          var out = [];
          (c.items || []).forEach(function (i) {
            (i.line_level_discount_allocations || []).forEach(function (x) {
              out.push({ title: x.discount_application && x.discount_application.title, amount: x.amount });
            });
          });
          (c.cart_level_discount_applications || []).forEach(function (d) {
            out.push({ title: d.title, amount: d.total_allocated_amount });
          });
          return out;
        }
        function label() {
          return root.getAttribute('data-state') === 'offer'
            ? btn.getAttribute('data-label-offer')
            : btn.getAttribute('data-label-plain');
        }
        /* Shopify's own cart decides: its discount list for the in-bag
           state, the rule on the bag after the add for the rest. */
        function paint(c) {
          if (!c || !c.items || !root.isConnected) return;
          var g = 0, h = 0;
          c.items.forEach(function (i) {
            if (i.product_id === aId) g += i.quantity;
            else if (i.product_id === bId) h += i.quantity;
          });
          var inBag = discounts(c).some(function (d) { return d.title === title && Number(d.amount) > 0; });
          root.setAttribute('data-state', inBag ? 'in-bag' : (applies(g + 1, h + 1) ? 'offer' : 'blocked'));
          if (!busy && !soldOut) btn.textContent = label();
        }
        document.addEventListener('cart:painted', function (e) { paint(e.detail); });
        /* zorev.js paints the cart on every page load; only a page without
           it asks for the bag itself. */
        function selfCheck() {
          if (window.ZorevCart || !window.fetch) return;
          fetch('/cart.js', { headers: { Accept: 'application/json' } })
            .then(function (r) { return r.ok ? r.json() : null; })
            .then(paint)
            .catch(function () {});
        }
        if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', selfCheck);
        else selfCheck();

        /* Option -> packshot. */
        var stands = Array.prototype.slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-zpr-cut]'));
        function showCut(id) {
          var hit = stands.filter(function (s) { return s.getAttribute('data-zpr-cut') === String(id); })[0];
          if (!hit) return;
          stands.forEach(function (s) { s.classList.toggle('is-off', s !== hit); });
        }
        /* The radios post as items[][id] without script. With script they
           become pair_a, and a hidden items[][id] in their place carries the
           choice, so Shopify's analytics listener never sees a "variant id"
           input change on a page without a product. */
        var radios = Array.prototype.slice.call(form.querySelectorAll('input[type="radio"][data-zpr-opt]'));
        var mirror = null;
        if (radios.length) {
          var firstQty = form.querySelector('input[name="items[][quantity]"]');
          mirror = document.createElement('input');
          mirror.type = 'hidden';
          mirror.name = 'items[][id]';
          mirror.setAttribute('data-zpr-mirror', '');
          var on = radios.filter(function (r) { return r.checked; })[0] || radios[0];
          mirror.value = on.value;
          if (firstQty && firstQty.parentNode) firstQty.parentNode.insertBefore(mirror, firstQty);
          else form.appendChild(mirror);
          radios.forEach(function (r) { r.name = 'pair_a'; });
        }
        form.addEventListener('change', function (e) {
          var r = e.target;
          if (!r || !r.hasAttribute || !r.hasAttribute('data-zpr-opt') || !r.checked) return;
          if (mirror) mirror.value = r.value;
          showCut(r.value);
        });
        var c0 = form.querySelector('[data-zpr-opt]:checked');
        if (c0) showCut(c0.value);

        /* One POST of both lines; the drawer shows Shopify's result. */
        form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
          if (!window.fetch || !window.JSON) return;
          e.preventDefault();
          if (busy || soldOut) return;
          var opt = form.querySelector('[data-zpr-opt]:checked') || form.querySelector('input[type="hidden"][data-zpr-opt]');
          var b = form.querySelector('[data-zpr-b]');
          if (!opt || !b) return;
          busy = true;
          btn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
          btn.setAttribute('aria-disabled', 'true');
          btn.textContent = 'Adding…';
          if (err) { err.hidden = true; err.textContent = ''; }
          fetch(form.getAttribute('action') + '.js', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', Accept: 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ items: [
              { id: Number(opt.value), quantity: 1 },
              { id: Number(b.value), quantity: 1 }
            ] })
          })
            .then(function (r) {
              if (r.ok) return r.json();
              return r.text().then(function (t) {
                var j = null;
                try { j = JSON.parse(t); } catch (x) { j = null; }
                var e2 = new Error((j && (j.description || j.message)) || '');
                e2.shop = true;
                throw e2;
              });
            })
            .then(function () {
              if (window.ZorevCart) {
                window.ZorevCart.show(btn);
                return window.ZorevCart.fetch();
              }
              window.location.href = '/cart';
            })
            .catch(function (x) {
              if (!err) return;
              err.textContent = (x && x.shop && x.message) ? x.message : 'The pair could not be added. Please try again.';
              err.hidden = false;
            })
            .then(function () {
              busy = false;
              btn.removeAttribute('aria-busy');
              btn.removeAttribute('aria-disabled');
              btn.textContent = label();
            });
        });
      });
    })();
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcase -%}
